# Team Collaboration

Read `CONTRIBUTING.md` and `AGENTS.md` for full workflow.

## PR scope

- **One feature module per PR** — e.g. only `frontend/src/features/chat/`
- Changes to `shared/`, `components/ui/`, or `services/ai/` need team coordination
- Use feature flags for incomplete work: `frontend/src/features/feature-flags/definitions/`

## Branch naming

```
feature/{module}-{description}
bugfix/{module}-{description}
refactor/{module}-{description}
```

## Merge conflict prevention

- **Append** new exports to barrel `index.ts` — never re-sort
- Co-locate related files (component + hook + types in same feature folder)
- Promote duplicated code to `shared/` instead of copying between features

## File naming

- Components: `PascalCase.tsx`
- Hooks: `useCamelCase.ts`
- Feature folders: `kebab-case/`
